> Does stan does pass by value or reference? I was afraid that too many function calls might cause additional overhead.

By reference.  Specifically as (const T&) in C++ terms for
any class argument T like autodiff variables or matrices or
arrays and by value for primitives (double) or (int).

So function calls are basically free compared to everything
else going on.

