Subject: Error "Initialization between (-2, 2) failed after 100 attempts" with parameters defined
Message-ID: <KuHzbsE5cXY.VyochliJBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/KuHzbsE5cXY/m/VyochliJBgAJ>
