Subject: Re: [stan-users] Jacobian adjustments...
Message-ID: <qQrPB7fYU98.gGu3Ec75AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <qQrPB7fYU98.NzuaBu-_AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
