> On Oct 12, 2016, at 2:53 PM, krishna mohan <krish4...@gmail.com> wrote:
>
> Thanks Bob for the detailed notes. A couple of follow up questions: Where do I set the two you identified "adapt_delta" and "stepsize" parameters? Does the manual have details on what these are used for specifically? I will do some reading and not take up your valuable time.
>
> Krishna
