Subject: Re: fitting latent class multinomial logit model in rstan
Message-ID: <cDnjAVCN90Y.1VEQlGrABAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <cDnjAVCN90Y.W4OhcXS0BAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
