Subject: Fine tuning a multilevel poisson model
Message-ID: <fj1OyxrXXTU._vzZWxAfBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/fj1OyxrXXTU/m/_vzZWxAfBQAJ>
