On Monday, October 17, 2016 at 7:32:42 PM UTC-4, Stefano wrote:
> What about if C is a parameter. Would a parameter depending on another create problems of high correlation?

What you wrote implies that a transformed parameter depends on a parameter, which is irrelevant from Stan's perspective. Correlation between actual parameters isn't a problem per se, although it can exacerbate other problems.

