Subject: Beta Regression: problems with initial values (?) causes chain to fail in creating replicated values
Message-ID: <ftyqyWPFZqk.pP6WPoGrBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/ftyqyWPFZqk/m/pP6WPoGrBgAJ>
