So, CmdStan is working? The uname message just appears when uname isn't on the path. In RTools 3.3, uname wasn't distributed. Perhaps it is with 3.4. The way to verify is to type on the command line (run cmd.exe): uname.

If you have it installed, it'll do something. If not, it'll show you the same message you've seen about it missing.

>
