From ud6a22ac7ce11aa1b at groups.google.com  Sat Oct 22 22:24:02 2016
From: ud6a22ac7ce11aa1b at groups.google.com (malai...@gmail.com)
Date: Sat, 22 Oct 2016 22:24:02 +0000
Subject: Predicting outcomes with lower and upper bounds at 95% credible interval
Message-ID: <pkwHntVwjGI.KLLxYu0fCAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/pkwHntVwjGI/m/KLLxYu0fCAAJ>
