500 6 1 2 2 1 3 3 1
500 6 2 1 1 2 1 1 0
500 6 3 1 2 2 2 2 0
500 7 1 2 2 1 2 3 0
500 7 2 1 3 1 3 1 1
500 7 3 2 1 2 3 1 0
500 8 1 1 2 1 2 2 1
500 8 2 2 1 2 1 1 0
500 8 3 1 1 3 2 3 0

Per respondent I have 8 tasks, 3 choice in each task (there is no "none" option). If a profile (indicated by stim) was chosen, then it is coded as a 1 on that line.

I have attached the data (CSV file) and the R code and the stan code so one of the forum members might try and replicate my model to identify its' problems

Thanks

Krishna

