Did it recover simulated data?  I'd first want to know
all that index fiddling was doing the right thing.

Were some of the parameters highly correlated in
the posteriors or did they have very different scales?

We don't recommend those gamma(0.001, 0.001) priors.

And you probably want some kind of hierarchical model on
those hierarchical scales (lambda).

- Bob

