From u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com  Thu Oct 27 17:46:01 2016
From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Thu, 27 Oct 2016 17:46:01 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] A serious mistake in model block
Message-ID: <Jf-UBCX_Lj0.cv-ScRoRAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
