I guess I'll take the opportunity to answer my own question. I had a coding error when trying to implement the indicator variable for when arrival time is observed. Below is the corrected code which returns reasonable result matching the JAGS output.

stan_proof_of_concept <-"

data {
  int<lower = 0> N_obs;
  int<lower = 0> N_mis;
  real<lower =0> y_obs[N_obs];
}

parameters {
  real<lower = 0> rate;
  real<lower = 0, upper = 1> p[2];
}

model {
  for(i in 1:N_mis)
    target += log_sum_exp(log1m(p[1]) + exponential_lcdf(1|rate),
                          log1m(p[2]) + exponential_lccdf(1|rate));

  for (i in 1:N_obs) {
    if (y_obs[i] <= 1) {
      target += log(p[1]) + exponential_lpdf(y_obs[i]|rate);
    } else {
      target += log(p[2]) + exponential_lpdf(y_obs[i]|rate);
    }
  }
}
"

