Subject: Wondering about LKJ prior - is it really sensible? How to implement on constructed matrix?
Message-ID: <fBHNn2WvwXo.i9aw7oszBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/fBHNn2WvwXo/m/i9aw7oszBAAJ>
